{"title":"Virikh Templar","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 53 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 64 times (1.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(crafting catalyst)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>1,179</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>11,106</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>9,831</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>3,235</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>3,961</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>4,136</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>3,411</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>1,163</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.